TEXT.update({
    "原发布扫描覆盖 Google、Artifact Hub、GitHub 与 OpenAI 等常见密钥形态，但未明确拦截 Authorization 值、本机用户目录、AWS 与 Slack 凭据。": "The previous release scan covered common Google, Artifact Hub, GitHub, and OpenAI key patterns, but did not explicitly block Authorization values, local user-directory paths, or AWS and Slack credentials.",
    "统一扫描每个重建后的公开文件，新增 Authorization、用户目录、AWS、Slack 和私钥形态检查；第三方 HTML 的既有 Google 形态脱敏仍保留双哈希。": "Every rebuilt public file is now scanned uniformly, adding checks for Authorization values, user-directory paths, AWS and Slack credentials, and private-key patterns. Existing redaction of Google-shaped secrets in third-party HTML retains both hashes.",
    "模式扫描不能证明不存在所有未知秘密；结构化凭据值仍禁止进入证据和报告，发布后还要逐文件字节复核。": "Pattern scanning cannot prove that every unknown secret is absent. Structured credential values remain prohibited in evidence and reports, and published files still require byte-level verification.",
    "少量旧耗时异常会让 1.1.3 看起来存在未经证明的整体性能回退。": "A few anomalous legacy latency values made 1.1.3 appear to have an unproven overall performance regression.",
    "对同一四题、三个版本做三轮轮换，统一采用第三轮的 12 个耗时并重算均值、P50、P95；不按结果择优。": "Run three order-rotated rounds for the same four tasks and three versions, use the 12 third-round latency values uniformly, and recompute mean, P50, and P95 without selecting favorable results.",
    "全部通过任务中，1.1.3 的均值由 4,000 降至 3,706 ms、P50 由 3,444 降至 3,340 ms、P95 由 9,833 降至 7,983 ms；1.0.6 与 1.1.1 也按同一规则更新。共保留 36 次物理调用；正文、评分和任务判定未改变。": "Across passing tasks, the 1.1.3 mean fell from 4,000 to 3,706 ms, P50 from 3,444 to 3,340 ms, and P95 from 9,833 to 7,983 ms. Versions 1.0.6 and 1.1.1 were updated under the same rule. All 36 physical calls are retained; body text, scores, and task verdicts are unchanged.",

    "统一方法组合对比，补充 Moli 时延诊断": "Unify method comparison and add Moli latency diagnostics",
    "结果分析页改为一个可同时处理双方法和多方法的对比器，并重新排版任务与结果；issue #66 的回退线索经公网顺序轮换与本地固定页对照后，保留为未能单因归因的长尾现象。正式任务、分数和耗时不变。": "The Analysis page now uses one comparator for both two-method and multi-method comparisons, with redesigned task and result layout. After public-network order rotation and a local fixed-page control, the issue #66 regression signal remains a long-tail effect without a single established cause. Formal tasks, scores, and latency are unchanged.",
    "统一对比器": "Unified comparator",
    "双方法与多方法拆成两张大卡和两份结果表，控制项重复、页面拥挤。": "Two-method and multi-method comparisons used two large cards and two result tables, duplicating controls and crowding the page.",
    "保留一个方法 A、可多选对比方法和一组统一关系条件；结果只渲染一张同题表。": "Keep one method A, a multi-select comparison set, and one shared set of relationship filters; render a single matched-task table.",
    "支持有分歧、A 成功或失败、全部成功或失败、仅所选方法成功；不生成新分数。": "Support disagreements, A passing or failing, all methods passing or failing, and only selected methods passing; no new score is produced.",
    "结果排版": "Result layout",
    "双栏压缩了任务类型和方法列，中文类型被逐字换行，横向阅读困难。": "The two-column layout compressed the task-family and method columns, breaking Chinese family labels character by character and making rows hard to scan.",
    "组件改为全宽；任务类型并入任务单元格徽标，成功与失败方法用可换行状态标签展示。": "Make the component full width, move the task family into a badge within the task cell, and show passing and failing methods as wrapping status labels.",
    "窄屏仍允许表格横向滚动，任务名称、ID 和证据链接完整保留。": "Tables still scroll horizontally on narrow screens, while task names, IDs, and evidence links remain intact.",
    "Moli 时延线索": "Moli latency signal",
    "正式单次结果显示 1.1.3 在少数任务上明显慢于旧版，但无法区分版本、网络和页面等待。": "Single formal calls showed 1.1.3 substantially slower than older versions on a few tasks, but could not separate version, network, and page-wait effects.",
    "选择四个差异大的不同路径任务做三轮轮换复测，再用本地固定页各五轮测固定开销。": "Rerun four tasks with large differences across distinct paths in three rotated rounds, then measure fixed overhead with five rounds per version on a local fixed page.",
    "公网各题中位数有快有慢且波动区间重叠；本地固定开销未见 1.1.3 回退，因此不把 issue #66 升格为已确认回归。": "Public-network task medians vary in both directions and their ranges overlap. The local fixed-overhead control shows no 1.1.3 regression, so issue #66 is not promoted to a confirmed regression.",
    "纠正与失败重试": "Corrections and failure retries",
    "把所有后续调用都禁止掉会让已证实的错误无法纠正；反过来，失败后挑选更好响应又会制造 best-of 偏差。": "Banning every later call would prevent correction of proven errors, while choosing a better response after failure would create best-of bias.",
    "区分两条路径：错误命令、版本、裁判或参考按明确范围 supersede 并重测；普通失败可在测量前声明最多重试一次，保留两次物理证据且最后一次无条件生效。": "Separate two paths: a wrong command, version, judgement, or reference supersedes and reruns the declared scope; an ordinary failure may have at most one predeclared retry, retaining both physical calls and using the final one unconditionally.",
    "当前 1,050 条结果没有启用重试，issue #66 的诊断复测也不替换正式结果；后续协议可按需启用。": "The current 1,050 results use no retries, and issue #66 diagnostic reruns do not replace formal results. Future protocols may enable retries when declared in advance.",

    "增加同题方法组合对比，修复大输出卡顿": "Add matched-task method comparisons and fix large-output stalls",
    "结果分析页新增两方法差异和多方法交集；超过 256 KiB 的完整证据不再自动插入页面，改为按需加载或直接下载。正式任务、调用、判定、分数和耗时均未改变。": "The Analysis page adds two-method differences and multi-method intersections. Complete evidence over 256 KiB is loaded on demand or downloaded instead of being inserted automatically. Formal tasks, calls, verdicts, scores, and latency are unchanged.",
    "同题方法对比": "Matched-task method comparison",
    "旧页只能按方法或结果筛选 1,050 条调用，难以直接找到 A 成功而 B 失败、共同成功、共同失败或多方法分歧的任务。": "The old page could filter 1,050 calls only by method or result, making it difficult to find tasks where A passed and B failed, both passed, both failed, or several methods disagreed.",
    "新增两方法差异与多方法交集；每行沿用同一任务的已核验主判定，并链接到各次标准答案、实际返回和失败原因。": "Add two-method differences and multi-method intersections. Each row reuses the reviewed primary verdict for that task and links to every reference, actual output, and failure reason.",
    "这是集合分析，不产生新分数，也不把不同成功样本的耗时混在一起比较。": "This is set analysis: it creates no new score and does not compare latency across different successful subsets.",
    "大证据加载": "Large-evidence loading",
    "超过百万字符的输出自动下载并写入 pre 元素时，会长时间占用主线程，页面表现为卡死。": "Automatically downloading output over one million characters into a pre element occupied the main thread long enough to make the page appear frozen.",
    "超过 256 KiB 的文本先显示按需入口；用户点击后使用只读文本框承载完整内容，原始文件下载始终保留。": "Text over 256 KiB first shows an on-demand control. After activation, a read-only text area holds the complete content; the original-file download remains available at all times.",
    "只改变浏览器呈现时机和控件；发布包内证据字节及校验值不变。": "Only browser presentation timing and controls change; evidence bytes and checksums in the release bundle do not.",
    "版本与样本边界": "Version and sample limits",
    "Moli 1.1.3 比 1.1.1 少两题可能被直接解读成版本能力回退；京东偶尔可打开也可能被用来否定正式失败。": "Moli 1.1.3 passing two fewer tasks than 1.1.1 could be read directly as a capability regression, while occasional access to JD.com could be used to dismiss the formal failure.",
    "三轮配对诊断将瞬时请求、页面不稳定和当前主榜成绩分开；京东保留为网络与会话敏感的挑战样本。": "Three paired diagnostic rounds separate transient requests and page instability from current primary-ranking results. JD.com remains a network- and session-sensitive challenge task.",
    "当前主榜未启用失败重试，也不用诊断调用挑选更好响应；后续可预先声明失败重试，已证实的错误可按完整范围纠正并替换权威逻辑结果。": "The current primary ranking uses no failure retries and does not select better diagnostic responses. Future retries may be predeclared; proven errors may correct the complete affected scope and replace authoritative logical results.",

    "迁移到 Sites，并固化评测报告工作流": "Migrate to Sites and formalize the benchmark-report workflow",
    "报告迁移到新的 Sites 域名并保留原站点；仓库新增跨评测类型的报告 Skill，覆盖评测设计、证据、独立核验、影响范围重跑和发布门禁。任务、输出、分数和耗时不变。": "The report moves to a new Sites domain while retaining the original site. A cross-benchmark report skill now covers evaluation design, evidence, independent review, impact-scoped reruns, and release gates. Tasks, outputs, scores, and latency are unchanged.",
    "发布目标": "Release target",
    "旧发布脚本固定使用 artifact-hub.dev 域名，换会话可能继续更新旧站点。": "The old publisher hard-coded the artifact-hub.dev domain, so a new session could continue updating an old site.",
    "当前报告配置同时绑定 Sites 服务地址和站点 ID；发布、验证和正文链接从同一配置读取，目标不一致时拒绝更新。": "The current report configuration binds both the Sites service URL and site ID. Publishing, verification, and body links read the same configuration, and a target mismatch rejects the update.",
    "新站点为 UUAhhQMnrGwm；旧站点 bWkRP157EtF6 和 UeZE1vfcEOrM 均未覆盖。": "The new site is UUAhhQMnrGwm; the old bWkRP157EtF6 and UeZE1vfcEOrM sites were not overwritten.",
    "发布身份": "Publishing identity",
    "仓库 .env 中的旧发布令牌可能优先于用户目录的新 Sites 令牌，导致已授权后仍返回 401。": "An old release token in the repository .env could take precedence over a new user-level Sites token, still returning 401 after authorization.",
    "发布与验证脚本不再加载评测 .env，只读取显式进程环境或用户级令牌；设备授权时会备份不同的旧令牌。": "Publishing and verification no longer load the benchmark .env; they read only explicit process environment or a user-level token. Device authorization backs up a conflicting old token.",
    "只改变发布凭据来源，不改变任何 provider 调用或报告数据。": "Only the credential source changes; provider calls and report data do not.",
    "跨评测工作流": "Cross-benchmark workflow",
    "既有 benchmark-editorial 只负责正式解读文章，无法约束评测设计、评分核验、选择性重跑和报告发布。": "The existing benchmark-editorial skill covers formal interpretation articles, not evaluation design, scoring review, selective reruns, or report publication.",
    "新增 benchmark-report Skill，并由根 AGENTS.md 强制路由；规则适用于 Web Fetch、Browser Use 及其他系统对比，不绑定本报告页面结构。": "Add a benchmark-report skill enforced by the root AGENTS.md. Its rules apply to Web Fetch, Browser Use, and other system comparisons without binding them to this report's page structure.",
    "这是流程和维护门禁；本轮主结果仍为 1,050 条，同窗测速仍为 140 条，未重新调用 provider。": "This is a workflow and maintenance gate. The run still has 1,050 primary results and 140 same-window latency results; no provider was called again.",

    "固定默认报告证据与实测路线": "Pin default report evidence and measured paths",
    "默认重建现在只接受七方法、150 题和 1,050 条主调用的当前证据。机器可读路线改为本轮实际使用的原生 Markdown、Moli 自动原始响应和 node-html-markdown 2.0.0；分数、调用输出和耗时不变。": "Default rebuilds now accept only the current evidence for seven methods, 150 tasks, and 1,050 primary calls. Machine-readable paths now reflect the native Markdown, Moli automatic raw responses, and node-html-markdown 2.0.0 actually used. Scores, call outputs, and latency are unchanged.",
    "默认重建": "Default rebuild",
    "默认证据目录仍是旧的十二方法评测，新会话可能在没有报错的情况下生成另一份报告。": "The default evidence directory still pointed to the old twelve-method evaluation, allowing a new session to build a different report without an error.",
    "将已核验的七方法证据设为 current，并增加独立的当前报告配置文件；构建和证据检查会拒绝方法、数量、截止时间或路线不匹配的证据。": "Set the reviewed seven-method evidence as current and add a separate current-report configuration. Build and evidence checks reject mismatched methods, counts, deadlines, or paths.",
    "主结果仍为 1,050/1,050 条核验，同窗测速仍为 140/140 条核验；旧证据移入 research 目录保留。": "Primary review remains 1,050/1,050 and same-window latency review 140/140. Old evidence is retained under research.",
    "路线元数据": "Path metadata",
    "下载数据仍把 Chromium 转换器写成已淘汰的 pyhtml2md 1.7.0，也没有写明三个 Moli 版本处理直接文档和媒体的路线。": "Download data still named the obsolete pyhtml2md 1.7.0 Chromium converter and omitted direct-document and media paths for the three Moli versions.",
    "路线说明改为与运行器共用的当前定义：普通网页使用各自原生正文能力，Moli 直接文档和媒体使用自动原始响应，Chromium 使用 node-html-markdown 2.0.0。": "Path descriptions now share the runner's current definitions: native body output for ordinary pages, automatic raw responses for direct Moli documents and media, and node-html-markdown 2.0.0 for Chromium.",
    "只更正非判定元数据；任务、参考、输出、分数和耗时均未变化。": "Only non-verdict metadata is corrected; tasks, references, outputs, scores, and latency are unchanged.",
    "复发门禁": "Regression gate",
    "核验轮次依附在某一条版本记录中，新增版本时容易让核验页变空；通用 Moli 文件适配器仍可能给二进制响应附加 --dump html。": "Review rounds were attached to one release entry, so a new release could empty the Review page. The generic Moli file adapter could still append --dump html to binary responses.",
    "核验轮次改为独立的结构化记录并在构建时校验；Moli 直接文件统一使用裸 fetch；文档命令统一使用锁定的 uv 运行入口。": "Store review rounds as independent structured records validated at build time, use bare fetch for every direct Moli file, and run document commands through the locked uv entry point.",
    "页面只展示每轮范围、发现、纠正和未完成项；不增加核验结果下载。": "The page shows only each round's scope, findings, corrections, and outstanding work; no review-result download is added.",

    "完成七种方法实测、全量核验与同窗测速": "Complete seven-method measurement, full review, and same-window latency testing",
    "七种方法均完成同一组 150 个任务，共 1,050 次主调用；另有 20 题 × 7 种方法的 140 次同窗测速。Codex 任务代理在看不到机器结论和分数的条件下逐条核验 1,190/1,190 份输出，最终与当前评分一致，未决 0。": "All seven methods completed the same 150 tasks for 1,050 primary calls, plus 140 same-window latency calls across 20 tasks × 7 methods. A Codex task agent reviewed 1,190/1,190 outputs without seeing machine verdicts or scores; the final review agrees with current scoring, with 0 unresolved.",
    "七方法完整矩阵": "Complete seven-method matrix",
    "新增 Moli 1.0.6 后，旧的六方法分母和版本对比已不完整。": "Adding Moli 1.0.6 made the previous six-method denominator and version comparison incomplete.",
    "七种方法各执行 150 个相同任务，每个方法—任务组合保留一个权威逻辑结果；Moli 1.0.6、1.1.1、1.1.3 分列。": "Each of seven methods runs the same 150 tasks, with one authoritative logical result per method–task pair. Moli 1.0.6, 1.1.1, and 1.1.3 are separate methods.",
    "通过数依次为 Moli 1.1.1 135、Moli 1.0.6 134、Moli 1.1.3 133、Chromium 125、Lightpanda 119、Obscura 117、Kitesurf 112；总数只表示本评测集覆盖，不替代六类分榜。": "Pass counts are Moli 1.1.1 135, Moli 1.0.6 134, Moli 1.1.3 133, Chromium 125, Lightpanda 119, Obscura 117, and Kitesurf 112. Totals show coverage on this dataset and do not replace the six family rankings.",
    "独立核验账": "Independent-review ledger",
    "只检查失败项会漏掉假阳性，旧详情也曾把排版差异误判成内容缺失。": "Reviewing failures alone misses false positives; old details also mistook layout differences for missing content.",
    "Codex 任务代理逐条读取任务契约、标准答案和完整实际输出，主结果核验 1,050/1,050，同窗测速核验 140/140；机器结论和分数在独立判定前隐藏。": "A Codex task agent read each task contract, reference, and complete actual output. Review covers 1,050/1,050 primary results and 140/140 same-window latency results; machine verdicts and scores were hidden until independent judgement.",
    "当前自动假阴性 0、自动假阳性 0、未决 0；challenge-08、动态引文字段边界、飞书表格及直接文档路线等历史问题均以当前统一规则重算或重测。": "Current automated false negatives: 0; false positives: 0; unresolved: 0. Historical issues involving challenge-08, rendered-quote field boundaries, the Feishu table, and direct-document paths were recomputed or rerun under current shared rules.",
    "同窗测速": "Same-window latency",
    "主矩阵来自多个执行批次，远程网络、排队和本地资源竞争使跨批次耗时不能公平排名。": "The primary matrix spans multiple batches, so remote networking, queueing, and local resource contention prevent fair cross-batch latency ranking.",
    "另取 20 个预声明、域名互异的网页，同一窗口并行执行七种方法；延迟只比较全部方法共同通过的 8 个相同任务。": "Run seven methods concurrently in one window on 20 predeclared pages from distinct domains; compare latency only on the same 8 tasks passed by every method.",
    "Moli 1.0.6 的样本 P50 最低；8 题属于探索性小样本，P95 只作样本诊断，不外推为稳定尾延迟或 SLA。": "Moli 1.0.6 has the lowest sample P50. The 8-task cohort is exploratory; P95 is a sample diagnostic, not a stable tail-latency or SLA estimate.",
    "参考与路线纠正": "Reference and path corrections",
    "live-025 曾误用初始 HTTP 字节作为动态页面标准；Moli 直接 PDF/媒体若强加 --dump 会在取回产物前失败。": "live-025 incorrectly used initial HTTP bytes as a rendered-page reference; forcing --dump on direct Moli PDF/media inputs fails before retrieving the deliverable.",
    "live-025 改用独立浏览器渲染后的可见正文并重测七种方法；三个 Moli 版本对直接 PDF、DOCX 和媒体 URL 使用裸 fetch，正文题计入本地解析，文件题直接验收字节。": "live-025 now uses independently rendered visible text and was rerun across seven methods. All three Moli versions use bare fetch for direct PDF, DOCX, and media URLs; body tasks include local parsing, while file tasks validate bytes directly.",
    "标准、输入输出目标与评分入口对所有方法一致；各方法仍可使用自己最快的正式原生产物路径。": "Every method shares the same contract, input/output target, and scoring entry point, while retaining its fastest formal native-deliverable path.",
    "document-03 参考替换": "document-03 reference replacement",
    "旧 W3C PDF 地址在本轮变成 Cloudflare 验证页，继续使用会把站点拦截误当作 PDF 解析能力。": "The old W3C PDF URL became a Cloudflare challenge page; continued use would confuse site blocking with PDF parsing capability.",
    "改用 Mozilla PDF.js 固定 Git 提交中的三页 PDF，并重新调用七种方法；未变化的 1,043 条主结果及核验保持原样。": "Use a three-page PDF from a fixed Mozilla PDF.js Git commit and call all seven methods again; the other 1,043 primary results and reviews remain unchanged.",
    "Moli 1.0.6、1.1.1 取得全部三页文字并通过；Moli 1.1.3 单次请求失败，其他方法未取得可读正文。该单次结果不能单独证明版本回归。": "Moli 1.0.6 and 1.1.1 retrieved all three pages and passed; the single Moli 1.1.3 request failed, and other methods returned no readable body. One call alone cannot establish a version regression.",
    "标题诊断": "Title diagnostics",
    "标题指标先展示定义和空表，读者看不到输入、对齐和汇总过程。": "Title metrics previously showed definitions and an empty table before readers could see input, alignment, or aggregation.",
    "按读取条目、详情链接对齐、逐标题比较、可比结果汇总四步展示；没有可对照标题时明确显示不适用，不生成空表。": "Show four steps: read records, join by detail URL, compare each title, and aggregate comparable results. When no title reference exists, show not applicable instead of an empty table.",
    "标题诊断仍不参与任务通过判定，也不代表榜单召回、实时性或整页正文质量。": "Title diagnostics still do not determine task acceptance or represent list recall, freshness, or whole-page body quality.",
    "旧环境页复述每个批次，账号页又容易让人误以为报告应保存正式密钥。": "The old environment page repeated every batch, while the account page could imply that production keys belong in the report.",
    "环境和复现合并，只保留版本、二进制哈希、部署边界、配置文件和锁定命令；账号页仅列所需账号、变量名和官方获取入口。": "Merge environment and reproduction, retaining only versions, binary hashes, deployment boundaries, configuration files, and locked commands. The account page lists only required accounts, variable names, and official acquisition sources.",
    "正式密钥只从仓库本地 .env 读取，不进入 HTML、Git 或发布包；Kitesurf 的托管后端版本和本地部署不可复现边界单独披露。": "Production keys are read only from the repository-local .env and never enter HTML, Git, or the release bundle. Kitesurf's undisclosed managed-backend version and non-reproducible local-deployment boundary are disclosed separately.",

    "区分文字存在与字段边界完整": "Distinguish text presence from field-boundary integrity",
    "复核 Quotes 异步列表的两版 Moli 输出：10 条引文和作者均已取得，但相邻字段及多标签之间没有可读分隔。任务结果保持未通过，详情页改为按引文、作者、标签逐字段呈现，避免把边界损失笼统写成文字缺失。": "Review two Moli outputs for the asynchronous Quotes list: all 10 quotes and authors are present, but adjacent fields and multiple tags lack readable separation. The task remains failed; details now show quote, author, and tags separately rather than calling boundary loss missing text.",
    "字段级证据": "Field-level evidence",
    "旧详情把整条稳定记录标成未命中，即使其中引文和作者已经完整出现，读者无法知道真正失败的是标签列表边界。": "Old details marked the entire stable record missing even when quote and author were present, obscuring that the tag-list boundary actually failed.",
    "逐条展示引文、作者和标签的标准答案、实际解析值与判定；标签字符完整但分隔消失时明确标为字段边界不合格。": "Show each quote, author, and tag reference, parsed value, and verdict. When tag characters are complete but separators disappear, mark the field boundary invalid explicitly.",
    "只修正失败解释和分类，不改变任务契约、原始输出、耗时或分数。": "Only failure explanation and classification change; task contract, raw output, latency, and score do not.",
    "两版 Moli 复核": "Review of two Moli versions",
    "只看 Moli 1.1.3 会遗漏旧版是否存在同类问题。": "Reviewing only Moli 1.1.3 would miss whether the older version had the same issue.",
    "Moli 1.1.1 与 1.1.3 的该任务输出逐字节相同，均有 10 条完整且唯一记录；8 条多标签文字粘连，最后一条还混入 Loading 文本。": "Outputs for this task are byte-identical in Moli 1.1.1 and 1.1.3, with 10 complete unique records. Text is joined across multiple tags in 8 records, and the final record also contains Loading text.",
    "两版均维持未通过；单标签的第 9 条正常命中，说明规则检查的是标签边界而非引文是否出现。": "Both versions remain failed. Record 9, which has one tag, matches normally, confirming that the rule checks tag boundaries rather than quote presence.",
    "失败核验覆盖": "Failure-review coverage",
    "读者需要区分全量核验与只检查个别版本。": "Readers need to distinguish full review from checks of selected versions.",
    "主结果 900/900 全量盲审，包括 Moli 1.1.1 和 1.1.3 各 150 条；184 个机器失败项全部有非空独立审查证据。": "All 900/900 primary results received blind review, including 150 each for Moli 1.1.1 and 1.1.3; every one of 184 machine failures has nonempty independent-review evidence.",
    "各方法失败核验覆盖均为 100%，无未裁定结果。": "Failure-review coverage is 100% for every method, with no unadjudicated result.",

    "核对文档参考，纠正等价表格误判": "Audit document references and correct equivalent-table misjudgements",
    "逐项核对 10 个文档任务的冻结源、完整正文参考、正文分段契约和 60 次实际输出；同时复查飞书帮助文档的表格判定。文档参考没有截断；飞书任务原先把 Markdown 表格语法当成内容要求，造成 3 次误判，现已按相同输入输出目标统一纠正。": "Audit the frozen sources, complete body references, region contracts, and 60 outputs for 10 document tasks, plus the Feishu help-table verdict. References were not truncated; treating Markdown table syntax as content caused 3 Feishu misjudgements, now corrected under the shared input/output target.",
    "覆盖率展示": "Coverage presentation",
    "位置详情把一小段人工定位样例放在长标准正文旁边，容易被误认为机器只用这段短文本打分。": "Region details placed a short inspection snippet beside a long reference, which could imply that the machine scored only the snippet.",
    "结果页就地说明分母、分子和完整输入：覆盖率使用上方完整实际返回计算；定位样例只帮助读者人工确认一次命中。": "Result pages state the denominator, numerator, and complete input locally. Coverage uses the complete actual output above; the snippet only helps readers inspect one match.",
    "评分实现、保存输出、耗时和分数均未改变。": "Scoring implementation, saved output, latency, and scores are unchanged.",
    "最小 PDF 范围": "Minimal-PDF scope",
    "document-03 的源文件正文只有 Dummy PDF file，若沿用长文档任务说明，会被误解为参考正文缺失。": "The document-03 source contains only Dummy PDF file; a long-document description would make its complete reference appear incomplete.",
    "报告明确标为最小文档解析样本：冻结源文件全部可提取正文就是 14 个字符，只检查能否取得短 PDF 文字。": "The report labels this a minimal document-parsing sample: all extractable text in the frozen file is 14 characters, and the task checks only retrieval of short PDF text.",
    "该任务不能证明多页、表格或附录能力；六种方法本轮都未取得这 14 个字符，结果仍全部失败。": "The task cannot establish multi-page, table, or appendix capability. None of six methods retrieved the 14 characters, so all still fail.",
    "文档参考审计": "Document-reference audit",
    "嵌入文档任务只保存外围 HTML 时，读者无法追踪完整正文来自哪个 PDF。": "When an embedded-document task retained only surrounding HTML, readers could not trace which PDF supplied the complete body.",
    "document-07 记录查看器实际加载的 PDF、既有冻结文件路径及双重哈希；document-08 记录冻结 HTML 中的嵌入地址、独立下载哈希和提取正文哈希。": "document-07 records the PDF actually loaded by the viewer, the existing frozen-file path, and both hashes. document-08 records the embedded URL in frozen HTML, independent-download hash, and extracted-body hash.",
    "10 个文档参考与正文分段契约均核对通过，没有参考截断导致的分数变化。": "All 10 document references and body-region contracts passed review; no score changed because of reference truncation.",
    "Moli DOCX 口径": "Moli DOCX semantics",
    "报告把直接 DOCX 写成已经取得原始响应，但本轮 Moli 1.1.3 实际把该 DOCX 序列化为含包字节的 HTML。": "The report said direct DOCX returned a raw response, but Moli 1.1.3 actually serialized that DOCX as HTML containing package bytes.",
    "方法页改为如实描述自动选择结果：PDF 进入原始响应并解析，DOCX 没有形成可解析原文件并失败。": "The method page now describes automatic selection accurately: PDF produced a raw response and was parsed; DOCX produced no parseable original file and failed.",
    "不增加 curl 等外部兜底，不把其他下载器的成功归给 Moli。": "No external fallback such as curl is added, and another downloader's success is not credited to Moli.",
    "等价表格输出": "Equivalent table output",
    "飞书帮助文档原规则只接受 Markdown 管道表或 HTML table。Obscura 和两版 Moli 已完整返回三列表头及全部表格内容，但按阅读顺序展开为普通文本，因此被误判失败。": "The Feishu help task accepted only Markdown pipe tables or HTML tables. Obscura and two Moli versions returned all three headers and all table content in reading-order plain text, and were therefore misjudged as failures.",
    "删除与目标无关的表格语法限制；继续用 3 个稳定事实、五段正文覆盖和完整文本质量验收，同一规则作用于全部方法。": "Remove the task-irrelevant table-syntax restriction while retaining 3 stable facts, five-region body coverage, and complete-text quality checks under one rule for every method.",
    "沿用原始输出和耗时离线重评分，不重跑 provider；3 次结果由失败改为通过。": "Rescore the saved outputs and latency offline without rerunning providers; 3 results change from fail to pass.",

    "纠正文档与资源路线，并完成 900 条结果独立核验": "Correct document and resource paths and independently review all 900 results",
    "150 个任务 × 6 种方法共 900 次调用均有明确结果。Moli 1.1.3 的直接文档和媒体改用自动原始响应；Codex gpt-5.6-sol 盲审全部 900 条保存输出，分歧逐条裁定且无未决项。任务详情页直接展示标准答案、实际返回和判定证据。": "All 900 calls across 150 tasks × 6 methods have explicit results. Moli 1.1.3 direct documents and media now use automatic raw responses. Codex gpt-5.6-sol blindly reviewed all 900 saved outputs, adjudicating every disagreement with none unresolved. Task details show the reference, actual output, and verdict evidence directly.",
    "Moli 1.1.3 正确路线": "Correct Moli 1.1.3 path",
    "给直接 PDF 使用 --dump html/markdown 会在取得正文前报错，也无法真实衡量 1.1.3 的原始响应能力。": "Using --dump html/markdown for a direct PDF errors before body retrieval and cannot measure 1.1.3's raw-response capability.",
    "普通网页仍使用原生 Markdown；直接文档与媒体使用裸 fetch，由 CLI 自动选择原始响应或序列化页面。PDF、PNG、WebM 和 MP4 在本轮取得原始字节，DOCX 被序列化为 HTML 并失败。": "Ordinary pages retain native Markdown. Direct documents and media use bare fetch, letting the CLI select a raw response or serialized page. PDF, PNG, WebM, and MP4 returned raw bytes; DOCX was serialized as HTML and failed.",
    "只替换受实现影响的 7 个直接文档调用和 3 个直接文件调用；Moli 1.1.3 最终通过 133/150，旧版 Moli 1.1.1 为 123/150。": "Replace only 7 direct-document and 3 direct-file calls affected by the implementation. Moli 1.1.3 finishes at 133/150 passes; the older Moli 1.1.1 has 123/150.",
    "文档正文与文件分轨": "Separate document-body and file tasks",
    "下载到 PDF 或 DOCX 不等于取得正文，反过来正文任务也不应强制所有方法先转成同一种中间格式。": "Downloading PDF or DOCX is not retrieving its body, while body tasks should not force every method through one intermediate format.",
    "正文任务统一验收可读文字：方法直接给正文即可，只给原文件则把本地解析计入耗时；原始文件任务验收格式、长度和目标 SHA-256，不做无关 Markdown 转换。": "Body tasks uniformly require readable text: direct body output is accepted, while local parsing of an original file counts toward latency. Original-file tasks validate format, length, and target SHA-256 without irrelevant Markdown conversion.",
    "当前覆盖 PDF、DOCX、TXT 和嵌入文档；不声称支持旧 DOC、OCR、表格语义或任意办公格式。": "Current scope covers PDF, DOCX, TXT, and embedded documents; it does not claim old DOC, OCR, table semantics, or arbitrary office formats.",
    "全部结果独立核验": "Independent review of every result",
    "只复核自动失败项会漏掉假阳性；文件任务若只交给代理空文本占位文件，也会制造假失败。": "Reviewing only automated failures misses false positives; giving an agent empty text placeholders for file tasks also creates false failures.",
    "Codex gpt-5.6-sol 在看不到机器判定和分数的条件下核对 900/900 条结果；文件任务同时提供真实二进制证据，协议缺陷影响的 3 个批次单独重审。": "Codex gpt-5.6-sol reviewed 900/900 results without machine verdicts or scores. File tasks included real binary evidence, and 3 batches affected by a protocol defect were reviewed again separately.",
    "所有分歧均有可观察证据和最终裁定，0 条未决；同窗测速 120/120 另行全量核验。": "Every disagreement has observable evidence and final adjudication, with 0 unresolved; all 120/120 same-window latency results were reviewed separately.",
    "统一评分纠错": "Shared scoring corrections",
    "Markdown 链接边界会让实际存在的 Reddit 社区说明被误判缺失；百分号编码的相对下载地址也会漏判。": "Markdown link boundaries could hide an existing Reddit community description, and percent-encoded relative download URLs could also be missed.",
    "可见链接文字按排版边界还原；只把带文件后缀的尖括号相对目标按源页解析并 URL 解码，不把普通文件名 prose 当成地址。": "Restore visible link text at layout boundaries. Resolve and URL-decode only angle-bracketed relative targets with file extensions; do not treat ordinary filename prose as a URL.",
    "challenge-08 的两版 Moli 假阴性被纠正；Chromium 的 Blender 下载包地址改判通过。原输出、调用状态、耗时和内容哈希均不变。": "Correct two Moli false negatives on challenge-08 and pass Chromium's Blender package URL. Raw output, call status, latency, and content hashes are unchanged.",
    "乱码识别": "Corrupted-text detection",
    "请求成功和较长输出不能证明文字可读；run-9b35581eb0fdbbdea4a6 含大量替换字符。": "A successful request and long output do not establish readable text; run-9b35581eb0fdbbdea4a6 contains many replacement characters.",
    "统一检测 U+FFFD 的数量与占比，达到显著阈值时判正文解码损坏，并在详情页显示数量、比例和原始输出。": "Measure U+FFFD count and share uniformly. Crossing the material threshold marks body decoding as corrupted and shows count, ratio, and raw output in details.",
    "该调用仍为失败，但失败原因由笼统内容缺失改为可核验的解码损坏，不把乱码当有效正文。": "The call still fails, but its reason changes from generic missing content to verifiable decoding corruption; garbled text is not valid body content.",
    "任务详情重做": "Redesign task details",
    "旧页把一份答案的五个位置写成 body-region，标准答案和实际输出又藏在大量表格与折叠项后。": "Old pages called five positions in one answer body-region and buried reference and actual output behind many tables and disclosures.",
    "首屏显示任务 ID、方法、运行 ID 和结论；随后直接并排展示完整标准答案与实际返回。位置检查只保留汇总表，具体原文证据按需展开，运行字段统一折叠到页尾。": "Show task ID, method, run ID, and conclusion above the fold, followed by side-by-side complete reference and actual output. Keep one region summary, disclose source evidence on demand, and collapse run fields at the page end.",
    "只改变证据呈现，不修改任何任务、输出、分数或耗时。": "Only evidence presentation changes; no task, output, score, or latency does.",
    "版本追溯": "Version traceability",
    "运行时版本字符串缺失时，仅写产品名无法证明测试的是哪个构建。": "When a runtime version string is missing, a product name alone cannot identify the tested build.",
    "本地实现按二进制 SHA-256 固定：Moli 1.1.1 与官方归档事后逐字节匹配，Moli 1.1.3 和 Chromium 保留运行时版本与哈希；Lightpanda 以精确 nightly 哈希标识。": "Pin local implementations by binary SHA-256: Moli 1.1.1 was matched byte for byte to the official archive after the run; Moli 1.1.3 and Chromium retain runtime version and hash; Lightpanda uses an exact nightly hash.",
    "Kitesurf 是托管服务，服务端构建未公开，报告明确标为不可得，不伪造版本。": "Kitesurf is managed and its server build is undisclosed; the report marks it unavailable rather than inventing a version.",
    "证据打包": "Evidence packaging",
    "重新组装相同记录时改变 JSONL 行序会让独立核验哈希失效。": "Changing JSONL row order while reassembling identical records invalidates independent-review hashes.",
    "组装器保留源证据顺序，并将参考修订、评分修订和结果核验记录随报告发布。": "The assembler preserves source-evidence order and publishes reference revisions, scoring revisions, and result-review records with the report.",
    "900/900 指标可从保存输出复现；150 个任务和 6 种方法均无缺项。": "The 900/900 metrics reproduce from saved output; all 150 tasks and 6 methods are complete.",

    "完成五种浏览器最快 Markdown 路线的 750 次实测": "Complete 750 calls on the fastest Markdown path for five browsers",
    "Kitesurf、Lightpanda、Obscura、Moli 使用原生 Markdown，Chromium 使用渲染 DOM 加 node-html-markdown 2.0.0；150 题 × 5 种方法全部执行、独立参考生命周期与离线复评分全部通过。": "Kitesurf, Lightpanda, Obscura, and Moli use native Markdown; Chromium uses rendered DOM plus node-html-markdown 2.0.0. All 150 tasks × 5 methods ran, and independent reference-lifecycle and offline-rescoring checks passed.",
    "方法口径": "Method semantics",
    "旧草稿把五种方法强制写成相同 HTML 转换链路，掩盖了原生接口优势。": "An old draft forced all five methods into the same HTML conversion chain, hiding native-interface advantages.",
    "对齐 URL、Markdown 输出、任务集、验收规则和 45 秒截止；每种方法使用最快的正式或自带 Markdown 路线。": "Align URL, Markdown output, task set, acceptance rules, and the 45-second deadline; each method uses its fastest formal or built-in Markdown path.",
    "Kitesurf 走 Cloudflare 账号版 /markdown；三种本地 CLI 走原生 Markdown；只有无原生 Markdown 的 Chromium 做 DOM 转换。": "Kitesurf uses Cloudflare's account-level /markdown endpoint; three local CLIs use native Markdown; only Chromium, which lacks native Markdown, converts the DOM.",
    "Chromium 路线": "Chromium path",
    "旧 pyhtml2md 路线在大页面上转换慢，且普通网页少通过一题。": "The old pyhtml2md path converted large pages slowly and passed one fewer general-web task.",
    "以同一批已保存 DOM 对候选转换器复评分，采用 node-html-markdown 2.0.0，并保留 HTML、版本、哈希和转换耗时。": "Rescore candidate converters on the same saved DOM batch, select node-html-markdown 2.0.0, and retain HTML, version, hash, and conversion latency.",
    "本轮 Chromium 普通网页 98/100；转换属于客户端端到端耗时，不冒充浏览器原生能力。": "Chromium scores 98/100 on general web in this run. Conversion is part of client end-to-end latency and is not presented as native browser capability.",
    "历史判定审查": "Historical-verdict review",
    "旧规则会漏判跨 Markdown 链接换行、原生接口链接排版、排版空白和部分动态表达，也曾放行过不完整正文。": "Old rules missed line breaks across Markdown links, native-interface link layouts, layout whitespace, and some dynamic expressions, and also admitted incomplete body text.",
    "逐条对照 750 条保存输出、标准答案和任务契约，统一修正 43 个假阴性与 1 个假阳性；run-f4e6f2ee641e8baa9e3d 确认是误判。": "Compare all 750 saved outputs with references and task contracts, correcting 43 false negatives and 1 false positive uniformly; run-f4e6f2ee641e8baa9e3d is confirmed misjudged.",
    "修正规则对所有方法生效，不增加 provider 特例；原输出、调用身份和耗时不改。": "Corrected rules apply to every method without provider exceptions; raw output, call identity, and latency do not change.",
    "同步 main": "Synchronize with main",
    "上游任务规则与报告缺陷修正会影响旧结论。": "Upstream task-rule and report-defect fixes can affect old conclusions.",
    "合并最新 main 后复查影响范围；Django 教程参考变化，对五种方法全量同题重跑，其余仅在参考字节和评测契约等价时复用。": "After merging current main, review the affected scope. The Django tutorial reference changed, so rerun that task for all five methods; reuse others only when reference bytes and contracts are equivalent.",
    "Moli 该题新调用 browser exit，普通网页结果为 93/100；不沿用旧通过。": "The new Moli call for that task ended with browser exit, producing 93/100 general-web results; the old pass is not reused.",
    "公平性": "Fairness",
    "远程 Kitesurf、本地进程、不同 readiness 条件和转换时间可能被误读为纯内核性能。": "Remote Kitesurf, local processes, different readiness conditions, and conversion time could be mistaken for pure engine performance.",
    "速度只在双方共同通过的相同 URL 上配对，并明确客户端端到端边界。": "Pair latency only on identical URLs passed by both methods, with an explicit client end-to-end boundary.",
    "结果不能推出同机 CPU/RSS、网络剥离后的引擎速度、持续吞吐、成本或 SLA。": "Results cannot establish same-machine CPU/RSS, network-free engine speed, sustained throughput, cost, or SLA.",
    "任务可识别性": "Task identifiability",
    "案例详情页只显示标题，读者无法从页面确认任务 ID。": "Task-detail pages showed only a title, so readers could not confirm the task ID on the page.",
    "案例页首屏与逐次调用页均显示稳定任务 ID；运行 ID、规则、参考与输出继续可追溯。": "Show the stable task ID above the fold on task and call pages; run ID, rules, reference, and output remain traceable.",
    "展示改动不改变任务、结果或分数。": "Presentation changes do not alter tasks, results, or scores.",
    "发布隔离": "Release isolation",
    "本报告与旧报告用途不同，覆盖旧站点会破坏历史链接。": "This report serves a different purpose from the old report; overwriting the old site would break historical links.",
    "发布目标固定为独立站点 bWkRP157EtF6。": "The release target is pinned to the separate site bWkRP157EtF6.",
    "旧站点 UeZE1vfcEOrM 保持不变。": "The old site UeZE1vfcEOrM remains unchanged.",

    "完成文件任务评测，建立报告完整性发布门槛": "Complete file-task evaluation and establish a report-completeness release gate",
    "36 次文件任务全部实际调用并判定：Moli 与 Crawl4AI 各通过 3 次，共 6 次通过、30 次未通过、0 次未测。整份报告的 1,800 个计划调用均有唯一结果和明确判定。": "All 36 file tasks were actually called and judged: Moli and Crawl4AI each passed 3, for 6 passes, 30 failures, and 0 unmeasured. Every one of the report's 1,800 planned calls has a unique result and explicit verdict.",
    "旧记录没有保存原文件字节，不能判定直接 PNG、WebM 和 MP4 是否取得。": "Old records retained no original-file bytes, so delivery of direct PNG, WebM, and MP4 files could not be judged.",
    "十二种方法各执行 3 个文件案例；最终配置对应的 36 次调用全部进行格式、长度和目标 SHA-256 验收。": "Twelve methods each ran 3 file tasks; all 36 calls under the final configuration were validated for format, length, and target SHA-256.",
    "Moli 与 Crawl4AI 各通过 3 次，其余 30 次未通过；未通过保留为真实结果，不删除有效困难案例。": "Moli and Crawl4AI each passed 3; the other 30 failed. Failures remain genuine results, and valid difficult tasks are not removed.",
    "原生接口范围": "Native-interface scope",
    "只测正文路径会漏掉产品公开提供的原生文件能力，并把局部配置误当成产品能力。": "Testing body paths alone misses publicly offered native file capabilities and mistakes one configuration for product capability.",
    "Moli 文件任务使用原文件字节输出；Crawl4AI 文件任务预先选择其原生 HTTP crawler，正文仍使用浏览器路径。": "Moli file tasks output original-file bytes. Crawl4AI file tasks preselect its native HTTP crawler, while body tasks retain the browser path.",
    "按任务开始前固定的公开接口评测，不做失败后兜底，也不把普通 HTTP 下载冒充 provider 结果。": "Evaluate the public interface fixed before each task, without post-failure fallback or presenting an ordinary HTTP download as provider output.",
    "计时边界": "Timing boundary",
    "“耗时”没有清楚区分服务端时间、下载、渲染、本地加工和报告处理。": "Latency did not clearly separate server time, download, rendering, local processing, and report processing.",
    "统一以客户端端到端计时：从发起 provider 调用到形成可评分最终答案；下载、渲染、提取、输入转换及文件哈希均计入。": "Use client end-to-end timing from provider-call start to a scorable final answer, including download, rendering, extraction, input conversion, and file hashing.",
    "评分、证据落盘、限速等待和报告生成不计入；供应商服务端耗时不参与排名。": "Exclude scoring, evidence persistence, rate-limit waits, and report generation; provider server-side timing does not enter ranking.",
    "完整性门槛": "Completeness gate",
    "以实际调用数作分母会让缺少计划调用的 8/8 看起来完整；两个覆盖列也重复。": "Using actual calls as the denominator makes an incomplete plan look complete at 8/8, while two coverage columns were redundant.",
    "改为“判分完整性 = 已明确判定数 / 计划调用数”，并检查每个 provider × case 恰有一个当前结果。": "Define judgement coverage as explicit verdicts / planned calls and require exactly one current result per provider × case.",
    "任一缺失、重复或无法判定都会在报告全局高亮为不可靠；完整性检查、报告校验与发布打包均阻止不完整结果发布。": "Any missing, duplicate, or unjudgeable result marks the report unreliable globally; completeness checks, report validation, and packaging all block its release.",
    "证据呈现": "Evidence presentation",
    "成功文件保存在包内但不易从调用页直接核验，变更页又堆叠多次同日修订。": "Successful files were packaged but hard to inspect from call pages, while the changelog stacked several same-day revisions.",
    "成功调用页提供文件下载、格式、字节数和 SHA-256；同日修订合并为一个正式版本，较早版本折叠。": "Successful call pages provide file download, format, byte count, and SHA-256. Same-day revisions are combined into one formal release, with earlier releases collapsed.",
    "只改善审计入口与阅读结构，不修改原始文件、分数或耗时。": "Only audit access and reading structure improve; original files, scores, and latency do not change.",
    "首页结构": "Home-page structure",
    "类别概览藏在详细榜单之后，读者需要先穿过大表格。": "The family overview sat behind detailed rankings, forcing readers through large tables first.",
    "六类任务概览前置，直接列出样本数、完整判分的方法数、最高任务通过率及对应方法；详细榜单留在后方。": "Move the six-family overview forward with sample count, methods with complete judgements, highest task pass rate, and matching methods; retain detailed rankings later.",
    "不同类别任务要求不同，最高分不能跨类别直接比较。": "Task requirements differ by family, so top scores cannot be compared directly across families.",

    "统一验收口径，纠正参考、成绩与报告结论": "Unify acceptance semantics and correct references, results, and conclusions",
    "保留 150 个案例、1,800 条原始调用；92 条任务判定改变，36 条缺少文件字节证据的历史记录从误记失败改为未测。原始输出和耗时不变。": "Retain 150 tasks and 1,800 raw calls. Change 92 task verdicts, and correct 36 historical records without file-byte evidence from failed to unmeasured. Raw output and latency are unchanged.",
    "正文参考": "Body references",
    "CSS 标准正文目录被误删，Django 文档混入站点外围内容。": "The CSS standard's body table of contents was removed incorrectly, while the Django reference included site chrome.",
    "按独立保存的源页面重新确定正文边界，并记录来源与参考哈希。": "Re-establish body boundaries from independently saved source pages and record provenance and reference hashes.",
    "全文 F1 随参考修正；旧低分不能直接归因于供应商正文噪声。": "Full-text F1 changes with corrected references; old low scores cannot be attributed directly to provider body noise.",
    "统一评分": "Shared scoring",
    "明确的名称—链接字段和合法 Markdown 软换行没有统一进入验收。": "Explicit name–link fields and valid Markdown soft line breaks were not handled uniformly in acceptance.",
    "所有方法共用同一答案转换和评分入口，排除请求回显与诊断日志。": "Every method shares one answer-normalization and scoring entry point, excluding request echoes and diagnostic logs.",
    "修正格式导致的假失败，不按 provider 名称设置评分分支。": "Correct formatting-driven false failures without provider-name scoring branches.",
    "正文覆盖": "Body coverage",
    "只检查开头关键词和最小长度可能让极短摘录通过长文任务。": "Checking only opening keywords and minimum length can let a very short excerpt pass a long-body task.",
    "有完整独立参考的任务增加最多五个连续区域的词语覆盖检查。": "Add token-coverage checks across up to five contiguous regions for tasks with complete independent references.",
    "它是内容覆盖下限，不替代全文 F1，也不保证语义或事实正确。": "This is a content-coverage floor, not a replacement for full-text F1 or a guarantee of semantic or factual correctness.",
    "动态字段": "Volatile fields",
    "商品任务要求的分期和配送字段没有被完整验收。": "Required installment and delivery fields in product tasks were not fully validated.",
    "按独立参考检查字段归属、数量、类型和唯一性；易变价格与排序不冻结为永久答案。": "Check field ownership, count, type, and uniqueness against independent references; volatile prices and ordering are not frozen as permanent answers.",
    "字段齐全不等于变化值真实或最新。": "Complete fields do not establish that volatile values are accurate or current.",
    "截止时间": "Deadline",
    "超出登记预算的结果仍可能计为成功。": "A result beyond the declared budget could still be counted as successful.",
    "新调用采用统一端到端截止；历史记录仅按已登记耗时和预算重判。": "New calls use one end-to-end deadline; historical records are rejudged only from recorded latency and budgets.",
    "不声称历史调用当时已经受新硬截止控制。": "The report does not claim historical calls were controlled by the new hard deadline at runtime.",
    "文件缺测": "Unmeasured file tasks",
    "36 条没有字节证据的文件记录被当成失败。": "36 file records without byte evidence were treated as failures.",
    "先改为未测并退出通过率分母，随后在 2026-09-04 通过真实 provider 调用补齐。": "First mark them unmeasured and remove them from the pass-rate denominator, then complete them with real provider calls on 2026-09-04.",
    "不以 URL、文本或其他方法的下载结果代替原方法文件证据。": "Do not substitute a URL, text, or another method's download for the original method's file evidence.",
    "结果解读": "Result interpretation",
    "不同成功子集的条件耗时被直接当成同题速度，部分文章结论超出证据。": "Conditional latency from different successful subsets was treated as matched-task speed, and some article conclusions exceeded the evidence.",
    "增加共同通过子集诊断，并明确单次、跨批次与参考范围限制。": "Add a jointly passing subset diagnostic and state single-call, cross-batch, and reference-scope limits.",
    "不能从本轮样本外推全网能力、稳定性或生产 SLA。": "This sample cannot establish internet-wide capability, stability, or a production SLA.",
})

